> explain (costs off)
> select a.id, ss.* from a33_a a left join lateral
>   (select b.w, c.x from a33_b b join a33_c c on b.id = c.id where c.x > a.v * 50) ss
>   on true order by 1, 2, 3
QUERY PLAN:text
Sort
  Sort Key: a.id, b.w, c.x
  ->  Nested Loop Left Join
        Join Filter: (c.x > (a.v * 50))
        ->  Seq Scan on a33_a a
        ->  Materialize
              ->  Hash Join
                    Hash Cond: (b.id = c.id)
                    ->  Seq Scan on a33_b b
                    ->  Hash
                          ->  Seq Scan on a33_c c
-- EXPLAIN

