> explain (verbose, costs off)
> select * from a33_a a left join lateral (select a.id as aid, * from generate_series(1, 2) g) s on true
QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop Left Join
  Output: a.id, a.v, a.t, (a.id), g.g
  ->  Seq Scan on public.a33_a a
        Output: a.id, a.v, a.t
  ->  Function Scan on pg_catalog.generate_series g
        Output: g.g, a.id
        Function Call: generate_series(1, 2)
-- EXPLAIN

